{"id":"u-a0d781eb-6392-4eb2-ac99-ebf044d4e4c9","src":"community","title":"Lean Powerlifter V 3.1","author":"Aswin Pradeep","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/DcaNyF-lean-powerlifter-v-31","desc":"This is an alternate day (4 days per 8-day-week) program for building progression through base strength increase . \n\nThis is a 4 day Bench Press and 3 day Squat program. Deadlift and OHP is at maintenance. However, expect some strength increase in both based on carryover from Squat and bench performance.\n\nWk1 - Base Volume\nWk2- Peak Volume\nWk3- Peak Intensity\nWk4-Deload\nWk5- Maintainence\nWk6- Test/ 2 Rep AMRAP\n\nIf your heart rate shoots above 145-150 bpm during deadlift or squat session , Add 45 min of Zone 2 cardio in between days. \n\nSpirit of this program is alternative cardio and strength days making it a 8 day week program looking at long term growth.\n\nExcept for forearms and niche bodybuilding muscles( eg tibialis), additional exercises are not recommended. However, the user is free to play with intensities and rep ranges keeping the INOL values same. Also, some exercises can be switched for closely related movements keeping the basic movement same ( Eg larsen press instead of Spoto press)","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":120,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-07T15:48:08.709Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":75}],"note":"Close Grip Spoto Bench Press"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":63,"x":4}],"note":"Close Grip"},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":58,"x":4}],"note":"Pin Squat"},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dum